#
# Hamarr means "hammer" in Old Norse.
#
# Perfect semantics:
#
# - The hammer is not the product, but the means;
# - Simple, short, and easy to use in the chain of command;
# - Silent authority.
#
# Proposed uses:
#
# hamarr install module-render    => lib/volundir/lib/modules/render_module.js
# hamarr install storage-json     => lib/volundir/lib/adapters/storage/json/adapter.js
# hamarr install integration-kzip => lib/volundir/lib/integrations/address_and_location/kzip/NAME.js
# hamarr install mapp-guilda      => vendor/mapps/guilda/
